{# L2 user style block. Source: "window" (M1: user's messages in this request) or "profile" (M2). #}
<user_style>
{% if features %}Measured habits of the user (match these):
{% for k, v in features.items() %}{{ k }}: {{ v }}
{% endfor %}{% else %}Not enough of the user's own messages yet: write casual, short, code-mixed Roman Urdu/Hindi + English, lowercase-leaning, light on emojis.
{% endif %}{% if samples %}
Messages the user actually sent (tone/spelling reference, don't copy):
{% for s in samples %}- {{ s }}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}</user_style>
